# Copy to .dev.vars for local dev. Never put real values in THIS file:
# it is committed. The Worker reads these, the browser never does.
MODEL_API_KEY=
META_MODEL_API_URL=https://api.meta.ai/v1
MUREKA_API_KEY=
# Optional: model id for Create mode (/api/muse/spark). Empty means the
# default in worker/muse.ts.
MUSE_SPARK_MODEL=
# Optional: the opt-in "Smart face" for the Kip selfie (/api/selfie/face-parts finds eyes and mouth with SAM 3.1,
# /api/selfie/cartoon redraws the photo with Muse Image). It sends ONE downscaled photo of the child to Meta's models, so:
#   - it is OFF unless this is exactly "on" (and MODEL_API_KEY is set);
#   - every request also needs the parent gate (x-parent-proof, needs the D1 binding and PARENT_GATE_SECRET or the seeded key)
#     and the client's consent screen (x-selfie-consent: v1);
#   - keep it OFF in production until the COPPA review is done.
SELFIE_CLOUD=
